### 1. 测试用户服务是否正常（GET请求）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/test
Accept: application/json

### 2. 注册新用户（POST请求）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "13812345678",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 3. 测试注册相同用户名的错误情况
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "13812345679",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 4. 测试验证码错误的情况
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser2",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "13812345677",
  "code": "111111"
}

### 5. 用户登录（使用我们之前注册的testuser）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 6. 用户登录（错误密码测试）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 7. 用户登录（不存在的用户）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nonexistuser",
  "password": "123456"
}


### 8. 先登录获取Token（用于后续测试）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    // 这是HTTP Client的脚本，用于保存Token到变量
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data);
%}

### 9. 测试Token验证接口
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/check-token
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 10. 获取当前用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 11. 更新用户信息
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/update
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "新的昵称",
  "contact": "微信：new_contact"
}

### 12. 再次获取用户信息（确认更新成功）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 13. 测试无Token访问（应该返回401）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info

### 14. 测试无效Token访问
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

### 1. 登录获取Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data);
%}

### 2. 头像上传测试
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/upload-avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=avatar123

--avatar123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"

< D:/test.jpg
--avatar123--